": "action", "text": "Tess takes the coffee.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "They stand there.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "The drum gets louder.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Abe, 60s, in a lab coat under a puffer jacket, pushes through with a megaphone he doesn't know how to hold.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "is this thing on? it's not on.", "name": "ABE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "it's the red button.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "which one's the red button.", "name": "ABE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Noor, 19, climbs onto a bench.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone looks up.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "hey. hi. so. we're like, two hundred people, and the thing behind us", "name": "NOOR", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the crowd"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She points.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The harbour.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "The water has pulled back, way too far.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "okay that's new.", "name": "RILEY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["muttered"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "A horn BLARES from the ferry terminal.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "A siren WAILS, thin and far away.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "all units, all units, tide gauges are reading minus four, I repeat, minus four", "name": "RADIO", "speaker": 6, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["from Gil's handheld, crackling"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Gil, 40s, an event steward in a hi-vis vest, jogs over, radio to his ear.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "okay folks, so, quick thing, we're gonna move uphill. calmly.", "name": "GIL", "speaker": 7, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "EVERYONE PLEASE MOVE UPHILL.", "name": "ABE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["into the megaphone, finally working"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "this is the thing we put on the signs.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Riley, quiet"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "yeah.", "name": "RILEY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "GIL, WHICH WAY IS UPHILL?", "name": "NOOR", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": ["from the bench, calling out"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "that way! the library!", "name": "GIL", "speaker": 7, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "The crowd starts to move.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Signs drop.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The drum stops mid-beat.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "A single raindrop on a sign.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "okay okay okay.", "name": "RILEY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["to herself"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes Tess's hand.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "They run.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}]}